#: libkopete/connectionmanager.cpp:144
msgid ""
"A network connection was disconnected.  The application is now in offline "
"mode.  Do you want the application to resume network operations when the "
"network is available again?"
msgstr "सञ्जाल जडान विच्छेदन गरिएको थियो । अनुप्रयोग अहिले अफलाइन मोडमा छ । तपाईँ सञ्जाल फेरि उपलब्ध हुँदा अनुप्रयोग सञ्जाल सञ्चालनमा पुन: निरन्तरता दिन चाहनुहुन्छ ?"

#: libkopete/connectionmanager.cpp:145
msgid "This application is currently in offline mode.  Do you want to connect?"
msgstr "यो अनुप्रयोग हालै अफलाइन मोडमा छ । तपाईँ जडान गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ ?"

#: libkopete/connectionmanager.cpp:147
msgid ""
"This application is currently in offline mode.  Do you want to connect in "
"order to carry out this operation?"
msgstr "यो अनुप्रयोग हालै अफलाइन मोडमा छ । तपाईँ यसलाई यो सञ्चालन चलाउन जडान गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ ?"

#: libkopete/connectionmanager.cpp:148
