#: libkopete/kopeteutils.cpp:38
msgid "You have been disconnected."
msgstr "तपाईँ विच्छेदन हुनुभयो ।"

#: libkopete/kopeteutils.cpp:39
msgid "Connection Lost"
msgstr "जडान विच्छेदन भयो"

#: libkopete/kopeteutils.cpp:40
msgid ""
"Kopete lost the channel used to talk to the instant messaging system.\n"
"This can be because your Internet connection went down, the service is "
"experiencing problems, or the service disconnected you because you tried to "
"connect using the same account from another location. Try connecting again "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Kopete ले आवश्यक सन्देश प्रणालीमा बोल्न प्रयोग गरिएको च्यानल हरायो ।\n"
"यो तपाईँको इन्टरनेट जडान विच्छेदन भएकोले हो, सेवाले समस्या महशुस गरिरहेको छ, वा सेवाले तपाईँलाई विच्छेदन गरेको छ किनभने तपाईँले अर्को   स्थानबाट उही खाता प्रयोगगरेर जडान गर्ने प्रयास गर्नुभयो । पछि फेरि जडान गरेर प्रयास गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: libkopete/kopeteutils.cpp:42
msgid "Can't connect with the instant messaging server or peers."
msgstr "आवश्यक सन्देश सर्भर वा जोडासँग जडान गर्न सक्दैन ।"

#: libkopete/kopeteutils.cpp:43
msgid "Can't connect."
msgstr "जडान गर्न सक्दैन ।"

#: libkopete/kopeteutils.cpp:44
msgid ""
"This means Kopete can't reach the instant messaging server or peers.\n"
"This can be either your Internet access is down or the server is "
"experiencing problems. Try connecting again later."
msgstr ""
"यसको मतलब kopete आवश्यक सन्देश वा जोडासम्म पुग्न सकदैन ।\n"
"यो या त तपाईँको इन्टरनेट पहुँच विच्छेदन भएको हुनुपर्छ वा सर्भरले समस्या अनुभव गरिरहेको छ । पछि फेरि जडान गरेर प्रयास गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: libkopete/kopeteutils.cpp:55
msgid "More Information..."
msgstr "धेरै जानकारी..."

#: libkopete/kopeteaccount.cpp:126
msgid "You have been disconnected"
msgstr "तपाईँ विच्छेदन हुनुभयो"

#: libkopete/kopeteaccount.cpp:126
msgid "You have connected from another client or computer to the account '%1'"
msgstr "तपाईँले खाता '%1' मा अर्को क्लाइन्ट वा कम्प्युटरबाट जडान गर्नुभयो"

#: libkopete/kopeteaccount.cpp:126
msgid ""
"Most proprietary Instant Messaging services do not allow you to connect from "
"more than one location. Check that nobody is using your account without your "
"permission. If you need a service that supports connection from various "
"locations at the same time, use the Jabber protocol."
